%% Sanctuary Bot: setting up an automation and one scheduled run.
%% Source: plugins/sanctuary-core/.apm/skills/operating-sanctuary-bot/scripts/ (bot.py -> automations.py, sanctuary_daemon.py, conductor.py)
%% No component outside the dispatched engine calls a model.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Human as Human partner (approver)
    participant Agent as Session agent
    participant Bot as bot.py (the one interface)
    participant Defs as .agent/automations/name.json (repo, via PR)
    participant Local as ~/.sanctuary/daemon (approvals, state, history, inbox)
    participant Daemon as Bot runtime: daemon + scheduler (0 tokens)
    participant Cond as Conductor (per run)
    participant Engine as Engine (shell / llama / codex / agy / claude via cli-agent)
    participant WT as Task worktree (git)

    Note over Human,Daemon: Session bootstrap never starts the bot or touches automations.

    rect rgba(127,127,127,0.08)
    Note over Human,Defs: Set up (interactive)
    Human->>Agent: "set up a bot that ..."
    Agent->>Bot: doctor / setup (plumbing, read-only if already set up)
    Agent->>Human: interview: what, when, steps, engine, rails, results
    Agent->>Defs: write definition, bot.py validate
    Agent->>Human: plain-language summary + worst case
    Human->>Agent: "go"
    Agent->>Defs: commit on a feature branch, PR
    Human->>Bot: approve name --by approver
    Bot->>Local: store approver + SHA-256 of the definition
    Agent->>Bot: start (if not running)
    end

    loop While running and idle (about once a second, ~0% CPU)
        Daemon->>Defs: read definitions
        Daemon->>Local: due? approved hash still matches? paused? previous run finished?
    end

    alt Definition edited since approval
        Daemon-->>Local: CHANGED_SINCE_APPROVAL (does not run)
    else Paused (by user, or after repeated failed runs)
        Daemon-->>Local: skip
    else Due and approved
        Daemon->>Local: record run id, next due time
        Daemon->>Cond: start run (detached): steps, rails, PREVIOUS RUN summary
        loop Each step (pipeline / backlog / sweep)
            Cond->>Cond: triage: next actionable step
            Cond->>Daemon: queue one job (timeout, worktree, engine)
            Daemon->>Engine: launch isolated in its own process group
            Engine->>WT: edit, test, commit
            alt Over the time limit
                Daemon->>Engine: SIGTERM group, 2 s, SIGKILL
            end
            Daemon-->>Cond: job result
            Cond->>WT: check: commit made, allowed paths only, verify command
            opt Check failed
                Cond->>WT: revert (task worktree only) and retry once with the reason
            end
        end
        Cond-->>Local: run state: COMPLETED / PARTIAL / EXHAUSTED / BLOCKED_ON_HUMAN
        Daemon->>Local: history + inbox.md line, optional notify command, auto-pause after N failed runs
    end

    Human->>Bot: status / history / pause / resume / run-now / stop
    Note over Agent,WT: The bot never pushes, opens PRs or merges; results go through the normal review workflow.
